OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Wight selected for
OL,4,Anational youth scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people on the Isle of Wight will
OL,7,Fbenefit from improved support services
OL,8,Fafter the island was selected to join a
OL,9,Fgovernment youth scheme.
OL,11,FIsle of Wight Council was named among
OL,12,F42 areas in England chosen to be part
OL,13,Fof the Young Futures Hubs and
OL,14,FTransformation Programme.
OL,16,FFunded by the Department for Culture,
OL,17,FMedia and Sport, the programme aims to
OL,18,Fstrengthen youth services and build a
OL,19,Fnetwork of Young Futures Hubs across
OL,20,Fthe country by 2029.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
